<mxCell id="p0-v30" parent="p0-v29" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="rpc PublishMenu(PublishMenuRequest)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;returns (PublishMenuResponse);&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;message PublishMenuRequest {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string menu_id  = 1;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;string channel  = 2;   // app | grab | lineman | shopee&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64  base_draft_version = 3;  // stale → ABORTED&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;message PublishMenuResponse {&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;int64 menu_version = 1;&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;topic catalog.menu.published&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;key brand_id:menu_id:channel   compacted&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;{ menu_id, channel, menu_version }" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="568" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v31" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Writes  ·  tables and outbox" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="632" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v32" parent="p0-v31" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Courier New;" value="menu_versions&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;brand_id · menu_id · menu_version&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;channel · body jsonb (frozen)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;published_by · published_at&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;menu_pointers&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;brand_id · menu_id · channel&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;current_version · version&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;outbox: catalog.menu.published&lt;br&gt;audit_log: same transaction" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v33" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v34" parent="p0-v33" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• A repeat publish of the same draft is ABORTED by base_draft_version, so no empty versions pile up.&lt;br&gt;• Consumers dedupe the fact on menu_version.&lt;br&gt;• Kafka limit is 1 MB, so the fact never carries the menu." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v35" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0-v36" parent="p0-v35" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• D-07: the menu version is the published state, not an offline copy.&lt;br&gt;• D-08: a BSL feed price change waits for the next publish.&lt;br&gt;• Sold-out is outside the version and is real-time (LLD 2).&lt;br&gt;• The pointer moves in-process after the commit; Catalog does not consume its own fact." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
