<mxCell id="p1-v2" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#64748B;fontFamily=Arial;" value="The store marks an item sold-out on the POS. partner-adapter turns the webhook into catalog.requested. Catalog flips the flag, refreshes the cache, and publishes the change.  Draft LLD: field names and status values are to be aligned with the business." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="46" width="1920" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
