<mxCell id="p1-v38" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Dedupe  ·  deadline  ·  retry" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1058" y="544" width="410" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v39" parent="p1-v38" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Command, so dedupe on event_id.&lt;br&gt;• A POS event older than pos_at on the row is dropped, so a late back_in cannot undo a newer sold_out.&lt;br&gt;• Retry 3× with backoff, then catalog.dlq, then Ack." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v40" parent="1" style="swimlane;startSize=32;rounded=1;arcSize=8;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#64748B;swimlaneFillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#0F172A;" value="Notes  ·  decisions cited" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="1484" y="544" width="460" height="400" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p1-v41" parent="p1-v40" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• An admin can flip the same flag over gRPC; the commit and publish are the same.&lt;br&gt;• Store staff use admin-bff with a store-manager grant; there is no store portal.&lt;br&gt;• PriceLines and GetMenu read the same Valkey set (LLD 3, 4)." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
