<mxCell id="p4-v32" parent="p4-v31" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• Fact, so dedupe on version: apply only when version &amp;gt; source_versions.version.&lt;br&gt;• A new Catalog pod reads the latest value per key from the compacted topic, then Acks.&lt;br&gt;• Retry 3× with backoff, then catalog.dlq, then Ack." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="378" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
