<mxCell id="p4-v34" parent="p4-v33" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#0F172A;fontFamily=Arial;" value="• D-07: consumers react by changing their own rows; they do not keep the other domain’s fields.&lt;br&gt;• GetMenu returns NOT_FOUND for a hidden menu (LLD 3).&lt;br&gt;• Rows stay when a brand goes not-live, so showing it again is a flag flip." vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="44" width="428" height="344" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
